    "text": "Given functional equality is<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br />Put <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> we get<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math> (since <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> )<br /><br />Now <math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\